/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In conclusion, the development of the solar-powered robot for solid waste collection represents a significant advancement in environmental technology. By harnessing renewable energy and integrating autonomous navigation and waste collection capabilities, the robot offers an efficient and sustainable solution for cleaning water bodies. Its diverse applications, ranging from river and lake cleanup to disaster response and environmental monitoring, underscore its potential impact on improving water quality and ecosystem health. Moving forward, continued refinement and deployment of the robot hold promise for addressing the global challenge of water pollution and advancing environmental conservation efforts.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
